    "offering_evidence_count": 12,
    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we had historically relied on our strategic partnership with BC Card to outsource certain services to them for our credit card operations, we began managing certain of our merchants in-house since 2023, and have developed and expanded our own independent credit card processing capabilities in order to reduce processing costs and improve profitability in recent years.",
        "start_character": 101372,
        "end_character": 101750
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Fees that we received for trust management services (including those fees related to property trust management services, described below, but excluding those fees relating to guaranteed trusts, which are eliminated in consolidation) amounted to ￦141 billion in 2023, ￦157 billion in 2024 and ￦181 billion in 2025.",
        "start_character": 118339,
        "end_character": 118652
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we and Woori Bank were each designated as a domestic systemically important bank holding company and a domestic systematically important bank, respectively, for 2025 and 2026 by the Financial Services Commission, which subjects us and Woori Bank to the additional capital requirement of 1.0% in 2025 and 2026.",
        "start_character": 249835,
        "end_character": 250157
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In April 2017, Kbank, formed by a consortium with KT Corporation and 20 other companies, in which we, through Woori Bank, own 9.2% of the equity with voting rights (following Kbank’s initial public offering in Korea in March 2026), launched its services to become the first Internet-only bank in Korea.",
        "start_character": 39459,
        "end_character": 39761
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In August 2019, we launched Woori WON Banking, our main mobile banking application, to provide enhanced digital platform services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 40241,
        "end_character": 40388
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to investment trust products, we provide our institutional clients with various investment advisory and discretionary asset investment services.",
        "start_character": 124704,
        "end_character": 124860
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to serving retail customers based on segment, we also offer products and services based on customers’ life cycles to optimize our financial solutions for such customers.",
        "start_character": 35770,
        "end_character": 35951
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we operate customer loyalty programs at Woori Bank for our most profitable small- and medium-sized enterprise customers and provide them with benefits and services such as preferential rates, free seminars and workshops and complementary invitations to cultural events.",
        "start_character": 57805,
        "end_character": 58087
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide commercial banking services to retail and corporate customers in select overseas markets.",
        "start_character": 110042,
        "end_character": 110155
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide mobile banking services to our customers, which is available to all our Internet-registered users.",
        "start_character": 87957,
        "end_character": 88079
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide project finance and financial advisory services, in the area of social overhead capital projects such as highway, port, power and water and sewage projects, as well as structured finance, leveraged buy-out financing, equity and venture financing and mergers and acquisitions financing services.",
        "start_character": 108274,
        "end_character": 108592
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168715",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-168715-5b0659f2b48cfbed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168715",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to boost employee morale and productivity, we aim to create an environment that nurtures development and growth and accordingly have implemented performance-based incentive programs to recognize high performers on both an individual and business group level.",
